    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSGameReviewZip">Review ZIP Package Contents</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipReviewUnavailable">A matching local ZIP is no longer available. No files were changed.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipReviewRejected">ZIP review was refused: {0}{1}No files were changed.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipReviewKeep">This may be an emulator-ready ZIP; keep or extract requires review.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipReviewExtract">Possible game launcher found; extraction requires separate approval.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipReviewAmbiguous">Archive contents are ambiguous; review the package manually.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipReviewLauncher">Possible launcher (not approved): {0}{1}</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipReviewCompleted">Read-only ZIP inspection complete.{0}Files: {1}{0}Uncompressed bytes: {2}{0}{3}{0}{4}Contents:{0}{5}{0}{0}No files were extracted, executed, installed or removed. The extraction/install workflow still requires an explicit choice.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipReviewFailed">ZIP review could not be completed. No files were changed.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipExtractTitle">Extract ZIP to Separate Cache Folder</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipExtractCancelMenu">Cancel ZIP Extraction</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipLauncherReviewTitle">Review Extracted ZIP Launchers</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipLauncherReviewUnavailable">No managed extracted ZIP and matching inventory receipt were found.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipLauncherReviewRefused">Extracted files or their ownership inventory have changed. No launcher is approved. Review the files manually.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipLauncherReviewEmpty">No supported Windows launcher candidates were found.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipLauncherReviewCompleted">Verified extracted ZIP inventory:{0}{1}{0}{0}Candidate launchers (first six):{0}{2}{0}{0}These are only suggestions. No launcher or installer has been approved or executed. Playnite install state and game actions are unchanged.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipLauncherReviewFailed">Launcher review could not be completed. No files were changed.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipApproveTitle">Approve Extracted ZIP Launcher</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipApproveNoCandidates">No eligible game executables were found. Installers, helpers and scripts cannot be approved here.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipApproveChoice">Approve this extracted game executable?{0}{0}{1}{0}{0}Yes: approve this file; No: next candidate; Cancel: stop.{0}No executable will run. After approval, Update Game Library to enable Playnite's Play action, provided the source and extracted files still match.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipApproveSuccess">Launcher approval saved. Use Update Game Library to refresh Playnite's Play action. Files were not executed or modified.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipApproveFailed">Launcher approval was not saved. Source, inventory or approval state may have changed. No files were executed or modified.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipRevokeTitle">Revoke ZIP Launcher Approval</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipRevokeUnavailable">No valid ZIP launcher approval is recorded for this game.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipRevokeConfirm">Revoke this ZIP launcher approval? Yes revokes it; No keeps it. The original ZIP, extracted game files, saves, and inventory receipt will remain untouched. Update Game Library afterward to refresh Playnite. An existing Play action may remain visible until it is refreshed; do not use it in the meantime.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipRevokeCompleted">ZIP launcher approval revoked. The original ZIP, extracted files, saves and receipt were preserved. Update Game Library to refresh Playnite's installed state and Play action. To select a different launcher, explicitly approve another candidate afterward.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipRevokeFailed">ZIP launcher approval could not be safely revoked. No game files were changed.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipMaintenanceTitle">Review Managed ZIP Maintenance</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipMaintenanceYes">Yes</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipMaintenanceNo">No</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipMaintenanceCompleted">Managed ZIP maintenance review:{0}{0}Status: {1}{0}Extracted files recorded: {2}{0}Folders recorded: {3}{0}Inventory verified: {4}{0}{0}{5}{0}{0}No files were changed. Automatic repair and recursive removal are disabled. If files differ, preserve game saves and review them manually.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipMaintenanceFailed">Managed ZIP maintenance could not be safely reviewed. No files were changed.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipLegacyUninstallRefused">Managed ZIP extraction exists. Use Review Managed ZIP Maintenance; automatic removal is disabled to protect saves and ownership evidence.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipBaselineUnavailable">ZIP contents and inventory were recorded, but a supplemental save-data baseline was unavailable. Strict inventory checks remain in force; newly created saves inside the extraction may block launch.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipRecoveryTitle">Manage ZIP Recovery</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipRecoveryBusy">Finish or cancel active transfers before moving a managed ZIP.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipRecoveryAmbiguous">ZIP recovery journal or folder locations are inconsistent. No files were changed. Preserve both folders and the journal for manual recovery.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipRecoveryAlreadyRestored">This ZIP recovery was already restored and finalized. The original files remain in place; no further recovery move is available for this journal.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipRecoveryCleanupInProgress">Permanent ZIP cleanup has begun or completed. Use the separate Permanent ZIP Cleanup action to inspect or resume. Recovery moves cannot be replayed.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipPermanentCleanupTitle">Permanently Remove Quarantined ZIP Files</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipPermanentCleanupRefused">Permanent cleanup is unavailable because the quarantined files or ownership records are not verified. Preserve all files and review manually.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipPermanentCleanupResumeConfirm">A prior permanently authorized cleanup was interrupted. Continue deleting only remaining original package files listed in its durable manifest? Unexpected files and saves must be preserved. This action cannot be undone.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipPermanentCleanupConfirm">PERMANENTLY DELETE the original files of this verified quarantined ZIP game?{0}{0}Folder: {1}{0}{0}This frees disk space and cannot be undone. All unexpected saves/mods block cleanup. The original source ZIP, audit journal and ownership receipt remain. Yes continues; No cancels.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipPermanentCleanupFinalConfirm">FINAL CONFIRMATION: Permanently remove the verified original ZIP package files now? You cannot restore them from this recovery folder afterward. Select Yes ONLY if you want irreversible deletion.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipPermanentCleanupSuccess">Verified quarantined ZIP package files were permanently removed. The original source ZIP and audit records remain. Update Game Library.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipPermanentCleanupBusy">This game cannot start while its quarantined ZIP files are being permanently cleaned up.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipPermanentCleanupCancel">Cancel Permanent ZIP Cleanup</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipPermanentCleanupPartial">Cleanup could not complete. Some original files may already be permanently deleted. Preserve the recovery journal and remaining files. Do not delete or replace anything manually; inspect the state before resuming.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipRecoveryNotClean">A managed ZIP can be moved to recovery only when its original inventory is unchanged and its launcher approval has been revoked. Any saves or modified content must be preserved and reviewed manually.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipRecoveryQuarantineConfirm">Move this verified, unapproved ZIP extraction to a reversible recovery folder?{0}{0}From: {1}{0}To: {2}{0}{0}Yes moves the entire folder without deleting files. No keeps it. Revoke launcher approval first and refresh Playnite afterward.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipRecoveryRestoreConfirm">Restore this ZIP from its recovery folder?{0}{0}From: {1}{0}To: {2}{0}{0}Yes moves the intact verified folder back without deleting files. No keeps it in recovery. Launcher approval is NOT recreated.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipRecoveryResumeConfirm">A ZIP recovery journal exists and the original directory is present. Retry the prepared reversible move? Yes retries after full verification; No leaves all files unchanged. No automatic deletion is performed.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipRecoverySuccess">Managed ZIP recovery move completed without deleting files. Ownership records and launcher approval state were not changed. Update Game Library to refresh Playnite.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipRecoveryFailed">Managed ZIP recovery was not completed. Preserve the journal, original ZIP, and both cache folders; review their status before retrying. No recursive deletion was attempted.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipLaunchBlockedTitle">Managed ZIP Launch Blocked</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipLaunchBlocked">PCLS blocked this ZIP launcher because its approval, current source, or extracted-file inventory could not be verified. No game was started. Review Managed ZIP Maintenance and Update Game Library before trying again.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipExtractConfirmation">Keep the current ZIP (No), or extract its verified contents to this new folder (Yes)?{0}{0}{1}{0}{0}No existing files will be overwritten. No executable or installer will run. Playnite installed state and game launch settings will NOT change. The result is a separate managed-cache extraction.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipExtractUnavailable">Extraction is unavailable: the destination is unsafe, already occupied or already recorded. No files were changed.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipExtractCancelled">ZIP extraction was cancelled. Existing source and game files were preserved.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipExtractFailed">ZIP extraction was refused or failed. Inspect the archive and cache settings. Existing files were not overwritten.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipExtractUntracked">ZIP files were extracted to {0}, but an inventory receipt could not be saved. Preserve these files and inspect them manually. The game has NOT been marked installed.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSZipExtractComplete">ZIP contents extracted and recorded at:{0}{1}{0}{0}The ZIP source was preserved. Playnite installed state, launch settings and uninstall permissions were not changed. Configure a launcher explicitly before playing.</sys:String>
