    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSSetupChooseSourceTitle">Choose where your library is stored</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSSetupChooseSourceDescription">For a folder on this PC, external drive, or NAS, select its location and PCLS will build a catalog. Choose an existing manifest only if you already have a JSON catalog. Cloud accounts require a separately configured rclone remote.</sys:String>
