    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSSetupScanTitle">Review the selected source</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPLSSetupScanDescription">For a local or network folder, PCLS previews up to 10,000 filesystem entries without saving changes. For a local manifest, it previews valid entries. Cloud accounts require a separate rclone connection check. Finishing the wizard saves configuration; use Verify Setup and Update Game Library to import.</sys:String>
